          "type": "mc",
          "difficulty": "medium",
          "stem": "A rectangular box has a volume of \\(72\\text{ cm}^3\\). Its length is \\(6\\text{ cm}\\) and its width is \\(4\\text{ cm}\\). Find its height.",
