            "\\(3\\text{ cm}\\)",
            "\\(12\\text{ cm}\\)",
            "\\(6\\text{ cm}\\)",
            "\\(24\\text{ cm}\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "hint": "Divide the volume by the length and width to find the missing height.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Use the volume formula and substitute the known values.",
              "work": "\\(72=6\\times4\\times h\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Simplify \\(6\\times4=24\\), then divide.",
